body:
I was thinking, we might want to have a way to show/hide the widget depending on a condition.

Let's say that I have two refinementLists. I show the first one by default and want to show the second one only if the first one is refined.

The api could look something like:

```
instantsearch.widgets.anyWidget({
    [...],
    showOnly: function (helper) {
      return helper.getRefinements('first-widget-attribute').length > 0;
    }
  })
```

What do you think ?
